	(95, 'series', 'toradora', 'Toradora!', 2008, 42916, '/2Z52nZaAQt1P7XJtu8fNlMXgdps.jpg', 10, 'Sparked the love for anime', 'I was not a big fan of anime, but this anime sparked Anime fewer in me and after that point in time I changed to loving anime. This series was the most significant choice I made to check out. The story trapped me from the first episode, and I couldn''t stop binge-watching it. It''s a rom-com, so it''s cheesy a hell lot of times, but that''s fine, it tells the story in such a way it doesn''t feel stupid or cheap, on the contrary, behind all the youthful foolishness tells a profoundly romantic story and deals with relationship problems in a mature way, that something similar hard to find in any other series or movies.', '2020-09-23 20:15:56+00', '2026-06-22 17:35:10+00', '2020-09-23 20:15:56+00', 15, NULL, NULL, 'A'),
