	(588, 'series', 'goblin-slayer', 'Goblin Slayer', 2018, 82591, '/x8ZQyxAFjz9jtCGivbOMYUC4Tp3.jpg', 7, 'Best goblin is dead goblin', 'The first thought after finishing it was - it is just exactly, how I would imagine JUDGE DREDD in the medieval fantasy world of adventurers (and it''s not Isekai 😁). It has brutal and gruesome fighting scenes, death, rape and even a girl pissing herself from fear of facing a deathly situation. It is just not what you see in anime every day. Also worth mentioning that the main protagonist has the same traits as JUDGE DREDD (you don''t even see his face through the whole series 😆 and he sounds badass),', '2022-01-03 19:39:35.176+00', '2026-09-21 18:18:43+00', '2022-01-03 19:39:35+00', 163, NULL, NULL, 'C'),
