	(75, 'series', 'saekano-how-to-raise-a-boring-girlfriend', 'Saekano: How to Raise a Boring Girlfriend', 2015, 69367, '/GP7I1yKTp6giJz2fdy0LBWo4zV.jpg', 9, 'Just amazing story', 'Two seasons and movie, perfect length to tell the whole story about the talented group of high schoolers trying to make a video game. The Series has everything needed - drama, love and light humour. The ending is very fitting and satisfying too.', '2021-09-13 13:51:56.717+00', '2021-11-02 23:18:34.517+00', '2021-09-13 13:51:56.717+00', 105, NULL, NULL, 'B'),
