	(1122, 'series', 'i-was-reincarnated-as-the-7th-prince', 'I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability', 2024, 213830, '/kMDJ2hdBTLZn33O53xCtE14fFD1.jpg', 8, 'Magic', NULL, '2024-06-17 17:44:43.203791+00', '2024-06-24 20:13:42+00', '2024-06-17 17:44:43+00', 115, NULL, NULL, 'D'),
	(377, 'series', 'dark', 'Dark', 2017, 70523, '/b0j0iRtR8Sl2s4HXVlht8rpqbWT.jpg', 10, 'Something really good from Germany', 'That is some rare diamond of the year  German''s know how to make a great story.  It''s first original German series I could not stop watching.  Really wonderfully thought out and complex story with a lot of characters, but uncovering connections between each other and their part in the story, makes you cringe to find out more and more. Constant unknown and new question keep the suspense, which never dies till the end of the season and even then gives more questions to ask and hope to see next season to get answers to wtf is going on. Even paranormality is shown in a very subtle way. Keeping track takes effort and thinking and that''s a great part of the series. Wonderful cinematography and visual telling style chains you not to miss anything what you see. Because it''s German series, it makes acting and relations in the story between characters feel more realistic and close to everyday life.  Later seasons goes more into time travel stuff and paradoxes, but it keeps story very strong, till the end. The complexity to follow story increases, but the way writer keeps it not messing up is amazing. Series have one of the most satisfying ends in this kind a Series, and brings almost all questions to the conclusion, without leaving holes in story. Real German work ;)', '2020-06-28 18:00:45+00', '2026-11-16 10:40:16.312+00', '2019-06-24 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, 4, 'S'),
	(465, 'series', 'love-death-robots', 'Love, Death & Robots', 2019, 86831, '/rlrRI2b6RvM9I9xOBTKqcTaehkE.jpg', 10, 'Recommended for all Science fiction fans', '18 Short stories, 18 different styles. Amazing Netflix attempt in this topic dealing with different problems or ideas.  The most outstanding one is "Zima blue" with wonderful storytelling and extraordinary visual style. "The witness", "Secret war", "Lucky 13" and "When yogurt took over" is also one of the Favorites of the series.  But not everything stands out, while some of topics is week developed or not my type. In The end this series is great time to spend.', '2019-03-25 10:04:35+00', '2026-11-16 10:41:03.553+00', '2022-05-19 22:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, 8, 'A'),
	(1060, 'series', 'why-raeliana-ended-up-at-the-dukes-mansion', 'Why Raeliana Ended Up at the Duke''s Mansion', 2023, 205366, '/gA9tCWV13QWIgDOdynah6FBmuxD.jpg', 8, NULL, NULL, '2023-06-26 18:11:58.178745+00', '2023-06-27 06:46:06+00', '2023-06-26 10:00:00+00', 167, NULL, NULL, 'B'),
	(1045, 'series', 'mobile-suit-gundam-the-witch-from-mercury', 'Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury', 2022, 196400, '/gBkDlMaAVOVMRWWlRUHhkLAhNE3.jpg', 10, 'I said I will never watch Gundam and look at me now... immediately top series', 'The team behind looks like was passionate about this project and put in a lot of effort, while it shines in animation quality. Every second or so episode has fighting scenes and each of them is so unique that it does not repeat itself and only brings something new to the story, so action is non-stop. The story starts pretty simple and a bit goofy or childish at first but quickly grows into something more serious as more subplots develop and politics get involved, and little by little mature into some serious shit. And then it reaches the first season finale... and oh boy... I was expecting some cliffhanger, but I have not imagined anything close to what actually happens. The last 30 seconds it just something else... it left me speechless and shocked about what I just watched. I can definitely say it''s one of the best anime moments I''ve ever seen, but it works so strongly because of what happens throughout the whole first season.  I''m looking forward for what happens next.', '2023-05-28 23:23:05.126975+00', '2023-07-02 13:41:45+00', '2023-07-02 10:00:00+00', 65, NULL, NULL, 'B'),
	(624, 'series', 'grimoire-of-zero', 'Grimoire of Zero', 2017, 70875, '/hqjNMqv0Pj4idFHsr5wUQRyJ8rV.jpg', 9, 'Beauty witch and the beast adventurers', NULL, '2022-04-01 00:55:48.808+00', '2022-04-04 10:54:10.19+00', '2022-04-01 00:55:48.808+00', 62, NULL, NULL, 'A'),
