	(49, 'series', 'madalorian', 'The Mandalorian', 2019, 82856, '/BbNvKCuEF4SRzFXR16aK6ISFtR.jpg', 9, 'Perfect Star Wars Story', 'If only new movies would be like this Series, then it would be peace on earth.', '2019-12-13 12:24:03+00', '2019-12-13 12:24:03+00', '2019-12-13 12:24:03+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(50, 'movie', 'fast-furious-presents-hobbs-shaw', 'Fast &#038; Furious Presents: Hobbs &#038; Shaw', 2019, 384018, '/keym7MPn1icW1wWfzMnW3HeuzWU.jpg', 3, 'Very childish movie', 'It''s like some 9 years old child wrote whole script. No logic, breaks rules of physics and very one sided predictable villain. Boring, but still watching like guilty pleasure.', '2019-10-17 20:14:44+00', '2019-10-17 20:14:44+00', '2019-10-17 20:14:44+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(51, 'movie', 'the-art-of-self-defense', 'The Art of Self-Defense', 2019, 480001, '/2yzkRUONrJV4jNj6FSEZBNRCzvC.jpg', 9, 'Jesse Eisenberg is best at weird movies', 'When Jesse Eisenberg plays in some weird movies, he really shines in that. This is that kind of movie.', '2019-10-09 19:33:30+00', '2019-10-09 19:33:30+00', '2019-10-09 19:33:30+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(52, 'series', 'disenchantment_s01', 'Disenchantment', 2018, 73021, '/1WynayCqKRzrl4cFZR8NOfiDwd6.jpg', 7, 'Little bit like disappointment', 'It''s slow to start and can be a little bit off-putting in the beginning, but if you keep watching, after 5 or 6 episodes everything starts to kick off and you start liking it. It has pretty good character development, maybe not the best introduction only.  EDIT: Sadly the second season complicates things with weird story development.', '2019-09-24 06:23:33+00', '2019-09-24 06:23:33+00', '2018-08-21 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(53, 'movie', 'men-in-black-international', 'Men in Black: International', 2019, 479455, '/dPrUPFcgLfNbmDL8V69vcrTyEfb.jpg', 3, 'Pretty dumb', 'Very unoriginal and predictable.', '2019-08-25 16:28:18+00', '2019-08-25 16:28:18+00', '2019-08-25 16:28:18+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(54, 'series', 'vikings', 'Vikings', 2013, 44217, '/94gP9uXNdbypwCLORjeurlad15Z.jpg', 9, 'Really good', NULL, '2019-08-16 10:32:19+00', '2019-08-16 10:32:19+00', '2019-08-16 10:32:19+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(55, 'series', 'the-boys', 'The Boys', 2019, 76479, '/dzOxNbbz1liFzHU1IPvdgUR647b.jpg', 8, 'Amazing and brutal', 'Really well done. In a time of so many super hero''s movies, this movie is new perspective if super heroes not as good as you they are presented. It has some really gruesome scenes, unmasked violence and crazy fucked up characters. Simply amazing. Looking forward for next season.', '2019-07-28 22:49:55+00', '2024-08-13 06:23:29+00', '2024-07-23 22:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(56, 'movie', 'extremely-wicked-shockingly-evil-and-vile', 'Extremely Wicked, Shockingly Evil and Vile', 2019, 457799, '/zSuJ3r5zr5T26tTxyygHhgkUAIM.jpg', 6, 'Interesting perspective', 'Ted Bundy from other perspective. Fine for evenings watch, but no real re-watch value.', '2019-07-19 18:16:48+00', '2019-07-19 18:16:48+00', '2019-07-19 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(57, 'series', 'the-last-kingdom', 'The Last Kingdom', 2015, 63333, '/wUFIEJCSmurmXPX0mP0cEgoltrk.jpg', 7, NULL, 'in the beginning was a bit messy, while a lot of things to learn and follow, but later gets very exciting and Intriguing.<br />  The fighting scenes are shot amazingly and the story with so many twists, misfortunes, betrayals makes story progression exciting and inpatient to find out what is going to happen next.', '2019-07-14 14:12:36+00', '2023-03-09 22:17:07.841+00', '2019-07-14 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(58, 'movie', 'shazam', 'Shazam!', 2019, 287947, '/xnopI5Xtky18MPhK40cZAGAOVeV.jpg', 2, 'Meh, not worth watching', 'Man... I don''t get it why it was so appealing to others (might be because all other recent DC movies suck and this one a slightly better).<br />  I can''t say it''s very bad, but it''s simply boring and unoriginal, with cheesy situations and dialogue.', '2019-07-14 11:37:51+00', '2019-07-14 11:37:51+00', '2019-07-13 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
