	(108, 'series', 'the-midnight-gospel', 'The Midnight Gospel', 2020, 96713, '/me3kxfiFRkdto6SmDQv0nczjfmP.jpg', 9, 'What creators ware smoking?', 'I think that''s most creative animation I ever seen, while most parts completely do not go with logic or rules. It''s like psicodelic dream, while someone is having philosophical conversation about world and life after smoking big joint.', '2020-05-25 22:35:06+00', '2020-05-25 22:35:06+00', '2020-05-25 22:35:06+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
