	(136, 'movie', 'alita-battle-angel', 'Alita: Battle Angel', 2019, 399579, '/xRWht48C2V8XNfzvPehyClOvDni.jpg', 7, 'Beautiful', 'Pretty eye candy and nice choreography of action scenes.<br />  Only not sure if it will continue with sequels, because it was not a big success in the box office, but I would definitively like to see how the story continues, while this movie just introduction and it ended without telling the whole story yet.', '2019-07-14 20:57:48+00', '2019-07-14 20:57:48+00', '2019-07-14 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
