	(236, 'movie', 'john-wick-chapter-2', 'John Wick: Chapter 2', 2017, 324552, '/hXWBc0ioZP3cN4zCu6SN3YHXZVO.jpg', 8, NULL, 'Really enjoyable action movie. This is one of the movies franchises where at least they not shooting infinite bullets from guns, here every bullet pretty much counts and that is what stands out of other action shooting movies. Of course, some of the story details makes question how situation even can exist like this, but it''s entertaining and that is important.', '2017-05-30 17:21:15+00', '2017-05-30 17:21:15+00', '2017-05-30 17:21:15+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
