	(255, 'movie', 'chappie', 'Chappie', 2015, 198184, '/hpnuXlKKWznTgbheGe4iQXzkuwJ.jpg', 1, 'Crappy', 'I would say "crappy" because after seen a trailer I thought it''s going to be awesome, but oh boy, I was disappointed. The story is horrible, acting is also shit. Hugh Jackman is playing stupid guy, Dev Patel is dislikable as in any other movie, and other actors is garbage. Not recommended at all.', '2017-03-14 20:19:17+00', '2017-03-14 20:19:17+00', '2017-03-14 20:19:17+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
