	(319, 'series', 'sex-education', 'Sex Education', 2019, 81356, '/4Bph0hhnDH6dpc0SZIV522bLm4P.jpg', 10, 'Only show where wokeness is acceptable', 'I do not remember the last time a TV series entertained me. It is simply wonderful.  School life, the hilarious premise of the story and a very smart portrayal of the discovery and dealing with sexuality. It picks up most of the problems you could expect and solves them with humour and a clever message.  This Series also very well portrays nonsense wokeness (because it''s the 21st century and must include that) in a way that''s not so cheesy or awkward.', '2020-01-17 22:17:20+00', '2023-09-26 11:03:09+00', '2023-09-24 10:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
