	(93, 'series', 'just-because', 'Just Because!', 2017, 74096, '/ciFnj3AQrKuNWbGmix4KKU5Lua.jpg', 9, 'Perfect', 'There is nothing to criticize in this anime (only that I would love to see more like this). From the beginning till the end it makes you enjoy unfolding story. The story itself is very easy - simple highschool love story triangle, but shown in the most natural and believable way, almost like real life, without cheap nonsense or cheesenes. And it has the perfect ending resolving all the plot points in the way, that no one is left disappointed. This anime makes your heart feel better in the end.', '2020-09-30 08:16:43+00', '2023-03-12 15:36:11.08+00', '2020-09-30 08:16:43+00', 134, NULL, NULL, 'A'),
	(405, 'movie', 'meg', 'Meg', 2018, 345940, '/xqECHNvzbDL5I3iiOVUkVPJMSbc.jpg', 3, 'Ridiculous nonsense', 'I don"t know what I was expecting from it, same as a trailer - brainless nonsense. The only thing in this movie what shines is graphic effects and action sequences. Why it all happens as you see is far, far away from logic land, but why the fuck you need that then you watching something similar like shark tornado movie. I still can"t decide if it"s so bad, that it"s actually good, or just pointless nonsense.', '2018-11-01 17:24:14+00', '2018-11-01 17:24:14+00', '2018-11-01 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(406, 'series', 'brooklyn-nine-nine-season-1-5', 'Brooklyn Nine-Nine', 2013, 48891, '/A3SymGlOHefSKbz1bCOz56moupS.jpg', 9, 'It''s an "Office", only in police', NULL, '2018-10-04 10:45:49+00', '2018-10-04 10:45:49+00', '2018-10-01 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(407, 'movie', 'a-prayer-before-dawn', 'A Prayer Before Dawn', 2017, 448776, '/73KrcLh1DpnBP3HwGpqoUUwKWF4.jpg', 6, 'Not so funny', 'Story in few words: boxing, drugs, prison, violence and other unpleasant things... So it''s movie about a boxer, but not like other movies about fame. It''s actually pretty opposite, it''s actually really sad story, based on true events.', '2018-09-24 06:34:07+00', '2018-09-24 06:34:07+00', '2018-09-23 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(408, 'series', 'castle-rock-s01', 'Castle Rock', 2018, 71116, '/6dnUpv9ghx84pgxlMOb4uuJrWDs.jpg', 5, 'I don''t know why I kept watching this', 'Was expecting way more after seeing trailer, but it left me really disappointed.<br />  Till the end I was hoping to see interesting things happening, but it got messy and bizarre in the end.<br />  It had it''s few good moments, but satisfaction was not fulfilled.', '2018-09-17 11:45:56+00', '2018-09-17 11:45:56+00', '2018-09-14 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(409, 'movie', 'jurassic-world-fallen-kingdom', 'Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom', 2018, 351286, '/c9XxwwhPHdaImA2f1WEfEsbhaFB.jpg', 1, 'Shinny Garbage', 'Couldn''t finish watching of boredom. Just visually good looking. Everything else from story and character is horrible wrong or horrifically bad.<br />  This movie literally buried whole Jurassic World experience from first movies. Now I''m never going back to watch this or any Jurassic World movies anymore in my life. Dinosaurs is dead, and this movie proved that there is no good Jurassic park movies.', '2018-09-08 13:50:06+00', '2018-09-08 13:50:06+00', '2018-09-07 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
