	(432, 'movie', 'kingsman-the-golden-circle', 'Kingsman: The Golden Circle', 2017, 343668, '/34xBL6BXNYFqtHO9zhcgoakS4aP.jpg', 5, 'Disappointing, but still fun', 'Feels disappointing. The first movie was something fresh and original, looked great. This one trying to feel kinda same, but only fails and is way less exciting.<br />  The action is great, acting is meh, but the story is horrible. And there is no action sequence like the church scene.<br />  Fun for one watch, but not big value to rewatch.', '2017-12-16 13:00:57+00', '2017-12-16 13:00:57+00', '2017-11-26 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
