	(439, 'movie', 'spider-man-homecoming', 'Spider-Man: Homecoming', 2017, 315635, '/c24sv2weTHPsmDa7jEMN0m2P3RT.jpg', 8, NULL, 'It''s enjoyable and fun to watch, but some of the elements are way too cheesy, little bit too much childish or more precise teenager-ish I would say.<br />  It has some funny moments as most of Marvel movies and action sequences are done amazingly good.', '2017-10-01 12:08:16+00', '2017-10-01 12:08:16+00', '2017-10-01 12:08:16+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
