	(441, 'series', 'narcos-season-3', 'Narcos', 2017, 63351, '/rTmal9fDbwh5F0waol2hq35U4ah.jpg', 9, 'Highly recommended', 'First two seasons were entertaining to watch and this one is no exception. Drugs, cartels, money and violence. Good story too, based on real facts, but a lot of this exaggerated for better and more interesting watching.<br />  Only be prepared to read subtitles :) only about 20% is in English', '2017-09-07 14:03:55+00', '2017-09-07 14:03:55+00', '2017-09-07 14:03:55+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(442, 'movie', 'baywatch', 'Baywatch', 2017, 339846, '/6HE4xd8zloDqmjMZuhUCCw2UcY1.jpg', 4, 'good once for laughs, but it''s <span class="text-danger">not</span> recommended', 'This movie is a guilty pleasure. Enjoying watching even if it''s horrible and worth a shit.<br />  Looks also good then you have few beers during the watch.<br />  Otherwise is the stupid story with more stupid actors and choices they make during a movie.', '2017-08-21 13:14:31+00', '2017-08-21 13:14:31+00', '2017-08-21 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(443, 'movie', 'alien-resurrection', 'Alien Resurrection', 1997, 8078, '/kzslFL1n01WI5lEcYzFSUi3Quik.jpg', 1, NULL, 'I way more enjoyed more watching Alien: Covenant or Prometheus, even they also very bad, but at least those were way nicer to look at.<br />  The acting in this movie is bad and unnatural and looks like they only had only dumb lines to say. CG is also kinda crappy, but it''s still in 90''s so nothing to complain. The story is a pile of shit stuck together with toilet paper and vomit. And mostly I have a complaint about the actual alien - the newborn alien in the movie is completely fucked up,  pathetically ugly - like a penis with a face.<br />  It how the wrong movie looks like.', '2017-08-12 23:18:50+00', '2017-08-12 23:18:50+00', '2017-08-12 23:18:50+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(444, 'movie', 'get-out', 'Get Out', 2017, 419430, '/tFXcEccSQMf3lfhfXKSU9iRBpa3.jpg', 8, 'must see!', 'A Very unexpected story with a really great twist in the story. Slow pacing good thriller.<br />  And some different and the unique feeling about the movie.', '2017-07-30 15:19:49+00', '2017-07-30 15:19:49+00', '2017-07-30 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(445, 'movie', 'alien-covenant', 'Alien: Covenant', 2017, 126889, '/zecMELPbU5YMQpC81Z8ImaaXuf9.jpg', 4, NULL, 'Just bad. They destroyed the mystery of aliens with some dumb story plot no one asked in the first place.', '2017-07-28 14:04:31+00', '2017-07-28 14:04:31+00', '2017-07-28 14:04:31+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(88, 'movie', 'steins-gate-the-movie-load-region-of-deja-vu', 'Steins; Gate: The Movie - Load Region of Déjà Vu', 2013, 225745, '/bXhogkZCR0aOQ077rfMULYbDmtH.jpg', 9, 'Perfect culmination of series', 'Just nicely ends up first season of Steins Gate and it''s story. But it''s far from the end of the story... yet ;)', '2020-11-06 18:57:51+00', '2026-11-16 22:22:02.292+00', '2020-11-06 00:00:00+00', 124, NULL, NULL, 'A'),
