	(483, 'movie', 'the-intern', 'The Intern', 2015, 257211, '/9UoAC9tu8kIyRy8AcJnGhnH0gOH.jpg', 9, 'Hearth warming movie', NULL, '2018-06-26 19:28:57+00', '2018-06-26 19:28:57+00', '2017-03-18 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(484, 'movie', 'the-ritual', 'The Ritual', 2017, 433808, '/9022CYEGqYETCeXN1oE3uwYJWub.jpg', 3, 'What''s the point?', 'The cinematography is nice, but what''s the point with a story? One guy gets alive from a bad hiking trip, where they encounter a devilish demon in the forest. Everyone dies. The main character just tries to survive and remembers some past accident, which have no sense for the plot at all. Very pointless. In the end, he''s the same guy with one past event he regrets, and now all his friends dead. Wtf? Pointless', '2018-05-16 20:30:33+00', '2018-05-16 20:30:33+00', '2018-05-15 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(485, 'movie', 'red-sparrow', 'Red Sparrow', 2018, 401981, '/vLCogyfQGxVLDC1gqUdNAIkc29L.jpg', 8, 'Nice', 'Wonderful spy movie. One of the better I seen in a while. As always is about Russian and Americans, but from Russia''s side spy who works against her will, and very well thought out the twist in the story. By watching you expect something to happen by intuition (you just know where it''s going), but how everything is unfolding is amazingly done, with surprises along the way. Wonderful actors and acting, great thriller story.', '2018-05-13 22:00:51+00', '2018-05-13 22:00:51+00', '2018-05-13 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(486, 'movie', 'black-panther', 'Black Panther', 2018, 284054, '/uxzzxijgPIY7slzFvMotPv8wjKA.jpg', 4, 'One of the weakest from Marvel movies', 'I simply don''t understand why so much people praise this movie as one of the top one''s in MCU. I love all the movies what Marvel brings, but this movie is one of the weakest in my opinion.<br />  Or maybe I just don''t like Black Panter''s character. Some kinda cat with a very tight costume :D<br />  The only character I rooted for was a villain, but sadly he lost in the end.<br />  This is the first Marvel movie I won''t going to watch once more again, while it''s also don''t bring much to MCU.<br />  It''s funny to see that in this movie for the diversity they needed include at least one white guy :D', '2018-05-02 21:50:51+00', '2018-05-02 21:50:51+00', '2018-05-02 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(487, 'movie', 'total-recall', 'Total Recall', 1990, 861, '/wVbeL6fkbTKSmNfalj4VoAUUqJv.jpg', 2, 'Painful', 'It was painful to watch it. Reboot is way better because the reboot at least decent movie.<br />  This one is just a garbage.', '2018-04-07 16:32:01+00', '2018-04-07 16:32:01+00', '2018-04-07 16:32:01+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(488, 'movie', 'redirected', 'Redirected', 2014, 190469, '/wmS0nA7EFQwwHYOeIfukgTnFz39.jpg', 10, 'Really interesting!', 'Emilis Velyvis - it says everything.<br />  Also because he is Lithuanian director.<br />  I will watch any movie of his like any Quentin Tarantino movie and will enjoy every single second, even the story is not so great and sometimes movie end without any outcome.', '2018-04-07 14:00:09+00', '2018-04-07 14:00:09+00', '2017-09-08 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(489, 'movie', '10x10', '10x10', 2018, 505177, '/egMETBYual2JtfFGigXTA0tGkME.jpg', 4, 'Very poor story', 'The intriguing beginning of the movie, but steep fall down to shitness in the middle.<br />  A start was thrilling because half of the movie you just asking why the fuck are you doing this. Nothing was explained and that was great. But as soon you find out why you start seeing a plot holes in the movie, and there are lots of them, just lots. There is also really poor character development, you just don''t buy main character''s motivation for all that he does. And all the choices he makes is really dumb or he is very not smart, even when he explained at one point he was preparing for kidnapping for a long time. And let''s do not start about coincidences in the movie, while they have no sense. Feels like it was a great idea, but it was abruptly fast written.<br />  Interesting thirling start before you flush story down the toilet.', '2018-03-19 21:46:55+00', '2018-03-19 21:46:55+00', '2018-03-19 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(490, 'movie', 'warcraft-the-beginning', 'Warcraft: The Beginning', 2016, 68735, '/k3a41SS1q5xmbvzPvzTIfG7GDlp.jpg', 5, 'Fine', NULL, '2018-03-17 13:53:53+00', '2018-03-17 13:53:53+00', '2018-03-17 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(491, 'movie', 'conan-the-barbarian', 'Conan The Barbarian', 1982, 9387, '/qw2A587Ee61IwcSOLNFRhuOACZZ.jpg', 8, NULL, NULL, '2018-03-03 19:35:26+00', '2018-03-03 19:35:26+00', '2018-03-03 19:35:26+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(492, 'movie', 'my-friend-dahmer', 'My Friend Dahmer', 2017, 445040, '/c6HoPIBcRv9l2tPB8hbivq71Nw.jpg', 5, 'One time watch', 'In the beginning, I found movie pretty interesting, but later it get''s a little bit messy and pointless.<br />  It shows Dahmer''s young life and explains some reason what led him to murder, but some of the scenes in the movie felt a little bit out of context or some missing connection with the whole story or maybe it needed to be there while it''s Biography, even it didn''t brought anything to the story.<br />  After one watch you most likely won''t be rewatching it anytime soon or at all, while it has no purpose or moral story in it.', '2018-02-26 21:31:05+00', '2018-02-26 21:31:05+00', '2018-02-26 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(493, 'movie', 'inside-man', 'Inside Man', 2006, 388, '/mf4i9zZVXMmqWsEb9D0OAY7k3t.jpg', 5, NULL, 'I would call this movie pretty generic crime &amp; little bit action movie.<br />  Nothing to remember much, acting is not so bad, but the story is forgettable. I don''t even remember why they wanted to rob a bank, apart from getting rich.', '2018-02-26 19:42:12+00', '2018-02-26 19:42:12+00', '2018-02-26 19:42:12+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(495, 'movie', 'murder-on-the-orient-express', 'Murder on the Orient Express', 2017, 392044, '/iBlfxlw8qwtUS0R8YjIU7JtM6LM.jpg', 2, 'Wtf? (Rolling eyes)', '<img src=''https://media.giphy.com/media/qmfpjpAT2fJRK/giphy.gif'' width=''250''><br><br />  I just simply can''t describe how horrible movie was. Of course, it''s beautifully shot and all, but man what a fucking lame jokes they try to put in it and that fucking detective''s persona (wtf?). And the whole point of the story is just ridiculous. I literally couldn''t stand the last 30min of the movie anymore. Painfully ludicrous story and main conclusion. Never again will watch this movie.', '2018-02-14 22:50:46+00', '2018-02-14 22:50:46+00', '2018-02-14 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(482, 'movie', 'inside-out', 'Inside Out', 2015, 150540, '/lRHE0vzf3oYJrhbsHXjIkF4Tl5A.jpg', 10, 'God damn... the feelings', 'Feelings have feelings and amazing story. One of the best movies (maybe even my favourite from Pixar) I have seen in a while.  Story flows perfectly and you get so familiar with a story. And how not to cry in the end.', '2018-06-26 19:31:19+00', '2026-11-16 10:38:40.545+00', '2016-06-12 00:00:00+00', NULL, 12, NULL, 'S'),
	(87, 'series', 'steinsgate-0', 'Steins;Gate 0', 2018, 78102, '/qOo0mPA228UIvEM4aoeLGp42tYp.jpg', 8, 'Good extension of the story', NULL, '2020-11-08 23:11:09+00', '2021-11-02 15:09:24.216+00', '2020-11-08 23:11:09+00', 127, NULL, NULL, 'A'),
	(496, 'movie', 'the-lord-of-the-rings-the-fellowship-of-the-ring', 'The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring', 2001, 120, '/56zTpe2xvaA4alU51sRWPoKPYZy.jpg', 9, 'Classic', NULL, '2018-02-11 15:28:55+00', '2018-02-11 15:28:55+00', '2018-02-11 15:28:55+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(497, 'movie', 'coco', 'Coco', 2017, 354912, '/eKi8dIrr8voobbaGzDpe8w0PVbC.jpg', 6, 'Beautiful, but not the best', 'I love Pixar movies and the style in which they make all the movies. They know how to make a movie which kids and adults (sometimes even more) can enjoy.<br />  This new movie has a nice message in it, but overall somehow movie itself not connected with me. It''s nothing bad in it, but nothing that makes you stuck to it or cry like most other of Pixar movies.', '2018-02-04 13:59:09+00', '2018-02-04 13:59:09+00', '2018-02-04 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(498, 'movie', 'thor-ragnarok', 'Thor: Ragnarok', 2017, 284053, '/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg', 10, 'must see!', 'The best Marvel movie in recent years, no doubt. Clever humour, great action scenes and just orgasmic visuals. Full package.<br />  Thor part of the movies was always on the weaker side, but this one brings it to the front of the others, and even more funny than guardians of the galaxy.<br />  It''s also a new twist on the Thor story is like Captain America winter soldier movie, it''s reviving the character and making him cool again and even more than that.<br />  Amazing movie.', '2018-01-26 17:25:50+00', '2018-01-26 17:25:50+00', '2017-11-11 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(499, 'movie', 'machete-kills', 'Machete Kills', 2013, 106747, '/nbnRAibyPSt0ProTJI3hH13KHaL.jpg', 4, NULL, 'It''s horrible to enjoy it. It''s good laughs for 30 first minutes,  but later it gets ridiculous and hardly enjoyable.<br />  Just a movie when you drunk or high.', '2018-01-20 09:40:59+00', '2018-01-20 09:40:59+00', '2018-01-20 09:40:59+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(501, 'movie', 'austin-powers-in-goldmember', 'Austin Powers in Goldmember', 2002, 818, '/c4Sus7BvVQM6i9M3Cr0U8Vw0L9f.jpg', 4, 'Too much', NULL, '2018-01-01 14:05:08+00', '2018-01-01 14:05:08+00', '2017-12-31 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(502, 'movie', 'austin-powers-the-spy-who-shagged-me', 'Austin Powers: The Spy Who Shagged Me', 1999, 817, '/wqcE8EAmVl5j3mLuIrHFG7RmQyg.jpg', 5, 'Fun', NULL, '2017-12-30 14:02:45+00', '2017-12-30 14:02:45+00', '2017-12-30 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(503, 'movie', 'bright', 'Bright', 2017, 400106, '/whkT53Sv2vKAUiknQ13pqcWaPXB.jpg', 6, 'Interesting, but messy', 'One weird blockbuster movie from Netflix. It just shows that they can easily make cinema worth movie, even when not putting it in one. But the decision to combine fantasy, dark violence, real world and crime movies, when it comes to a bit messy story of orcs, elves, magicians, and humans, is not so great. The development of story and characters is too messy and without heart. Politics shown in the movie is also bit underdeveloped and stereotypical. Was interesting to see, but needs more work on it, if they decide to make sequel.', '2017-12-29 01:07:41+00', '2017-12-29 01:07:41+00', '2017-12-28 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(504, 'movie', 'the-lego-ninjago-movie', 'The LEGO Ninjago Movie', 2017, 274862, '/vUo0pNXGhp2ffTJxiStWt6fHL7F.jpg', 7, 'Fun', 'Not as same as Original Lego movie, but better than Batman Lego movie.', '2017-12-10 16:33:43+00', '2017-12-10 16:33:43+00', '2017-12-10 00:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
